10:["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Horizon Obstructions & Light Pollution:"}]," Dense urban skylines, mountainous terrain, or high ambient artificial lighting can delay the unaided human eye’s detection of true dawn (*Subh Sadiq*)."]}]
